{"id":"d9555f490728227b","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-ana-de-rham-complex.md","title":"ZFC Ana De Rham Complex","display":"df-zfc-ana-de-rham-complex — ZFC Ana De Rham Complex","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ana-de-rham-complex","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ana-de-rham-complex"],"display":"df-zfc-ana-de-rham-complex — ZFC Ana De Rham Complex","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-omega]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]","[[58-df-differential-form]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ana-de-rham-complex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ana-de-rham-complex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ana-de-rham-complex — ZFC Ana De Rham Complex"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"58-df-differential-form\">58-df-differential-form</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Omega,d\\in V\">\\(M,\\Omega,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}\\)</span> (smooth-manifold predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S\\)</span> (differential-form predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"58-df-differential-form\">58-df-differential-form</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaDeRhamComplex}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaDeRhamComplex}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}de\\text{-}rham\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaDeRhamComplex}_S(M,\\Omega,d)\\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(d))\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\Omega(k)=\\{\\eta\\in V\\mid\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,k)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d(k),\\Omega(k),\\Omega(k+1))\\bigr)\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\Omega(k)\\;\\bigl(d(k+1)(d(k)(\\eta))=0_{\\Omega(k+2)}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}de\\text{-}rham\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaDeRhamComplex}_S(M,\\Omega,d)\\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_{S,n}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(d))\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\Omega(k)=\\{\\eta\\in V\\mid\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,k)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d(k),\\Omega(k),\\Omega(k+1))\\bigr)\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\eta\\in\\Omega(k)\\;\\bigl(d(k+1)(d(k)(\\eta))=0_{\\Omega(k+2)}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graded object is explicitly the family of differential <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-forms on one smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold, and every differential is typed between consecutive degrees.</li>\n<li>The final conjunct formalizes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d^{k+1}\\circ d^k=0\">\\(d^{k+1}\\circ d^k=0\\)</span> pointwise instead of equating a function with an untyped scalar <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 ·